-- Real historical backfill (Module 1.5 prep): ~95 real trading days (2026-04-09 through
-- 2026-07-28) fetched from NSE's real sec_bhavdata_full archive (same source and format as
-- Module 1.1's live collector) for the 8 seeded instruments. This gives the Technical Engine
-- enough real daily history to compute SMA20/50, RSI, MACD, ADX, ATR, OBV, and relative volume
-- against real data rather than the single day Module 1.1's daily pipeline run accumulates on
-- its own. SMA200 will remain unavailable (insufficient history, correctly reported as such)
-- until ~200 real trading days accumulate day-by-day in production - not backfilled further here
-- since NSE's free archive requires one fetch per trading day per symbol and 200 days x 8 symbols
-- starts costing meaningfully more time for one indicator's earliest availability.
--
-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING: today's row (2026-07-28) may already exist from Module 1.1's own daily
-- pipeline run: same source, so values should already match; this migration only fills gaps.
